<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-Hant">
<head>
  <meta charset="utf-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow">
  <link rel="icon" href="data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns='http://www.w3.org/2000/svg' viewBox='0 0 32 32'%3E%3Crect width='32' height='32' rx='6' fill='%23f4dc00'/%3E%3Cpath d='M8 9h16v4H8zm0 10h16v4H8z' fill='%23171717'/%3E%3C/svg%3E">
  <title>{{ project_name | e }}｜內部專案網站</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --ink: #171717;
      --muted: #5f6368;
      --line: #d8d8d8;
      --panel: #f3f3f1;
      --yellow: #f4dc00;
      --green: #16845b;
      --blue: #175b96;
    }
    * { box-sizing: border-box; }
    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
    body {
      margin: 0;
      background: #242424;
      color: var(--ink);
      font-family: Inter, "Noto Sans TC", "PingFang TC", "Microsoft JhengHei", sans-serif;
      line-height: 1.55;
    }
    a { color: inherit; }
    code { color: var(--blue); font-weight: 700; }
    .skip-link { position: absolute; left: -9999px; }
    .skip-link:focus { left: 16px; top: 16px; z-index: 10; background: white; padding: 10px; }
    .site {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 220px minmax(0, 1fr);
      width: min(1440px, calc(100% - 48px));
      min-height: calc(100vh - 48px);
      margin: 24px auto;
      background: white;
      box-shadow: 0 18px 60px rgb(0 0 0 / 28%);
    }
    .sidebar {
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      align-self: start;
      height: 100vh;
      padding: 30px 20px;
      border-right: 1px solid var(--line);
      background: var(--panel);
    }
    .brand { margin: 0 0 26px; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: .08em; }
    .brand::after { display: block; width: 44px; height: 5px; margin-top: 10px; background: var(--yellow); content: ""; }
    .sidebar nav { display: grid; gap: 6px; }
    .sidebar nav a { padding: 8px 10px; border-left: 4px solid transparent; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 750; }
    .sidebar nav a:hover, .sidebar nav a:focus-visible { border-color: var(--yellow); background: white; outline: none; }
    .sidebar small { position: absolute; bottom: 28px; color: var(--muted); }
    main { min-width: 0; padding: clamp(32px, 5vw, 72px); }
    .hero { padding-bottom: 34px; border-bottom: 7px solid var(--yellow); }
    .eyebrow { margin: 0 0 8px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: .08em; text-transform: uppercase; }
    h1 { margin: 0; font-size: clamp(34px, 5vw, 64px); line-height: 1.05; }
    .lead { max-width: 850px; margin: 18px 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: 20px; }
    .badges { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; }
    .badge { padding: 5px 10px; border: 1px solid var(--line); background: var(--panel); font-size: 13px; font-weight: 800; }
    section { scroll-margin-top: 24px; padding: 42px 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
    h2 { margin: 0 0 18px; font-size: clamp(25px, 3vw, 38px); line-height: 1.15; }
    h2 span { background: linear-gradient(transparent 62%, var(--yellow) 0); }
    .cards { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr)); gap: 14px; }
    .card { padding: 18px; border: 1px solid var(--line); background: #fff; }
    .card strong { display: block; margin-bottom: 6px; }
    .card p { margin: 0; color: var(--muted); }
    .command { margin: 0; padding: 18px; overflow: auto; background: var(--ink); color: #f8f8f8; font-size: 14px; }
    .table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; }
    .table th, .table td { padding: 12px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); text-align: left; vertical-align: top; }
    .table th { background: var(--panel); }
    .notice { padding: 16px 18px; border-left: 6px solid var(--green); background: #edf7f2; }
    .notice.optional { border-color: var(--yellow); background: #fffbea; }
    footer { padding-top: 32px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 13px; }
    @media (max-width: 920px) {
      .site { grid-template-columns: 1fr; width: min(100% - 24px, 760px); margin: 12px auto; }
      .sidebar { position: static; width: 100%; height: auto; border-right: 0; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); }
      .sidebar nav { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
      .sidebar small { position: static; display: block; margin-top: 18px; }
      .cards { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .table { display: block; max-width: 100%; overflow-x: auto; }
    }
  </style>
  <script src="site-content.js" defer></script>
  <script defer>
    window.addEventListener("DOMContentLoaded", () => {
      const data = window.CSARC_SITE_CONTENT;
      if (!data) {
        document.querySelector("main").textContent = "找不到 docs/site-content.js。";
        return;
      }

      const text = (selector, value) => {
        document.querySelector(selector).textContent = value;
      };
      const list = (selector, values) => {
        const root = document.querySelector(selector);
        for (const value of values) {
          const item = document.createElement("span");
          item.className = "badge";
          item.textContent = value;
          root.append(item);
        }
      };

      text("#project-name", data.project.name);
      text("#project-description", data.project.description);
      list("#project-badges", [data.project.stage, data.project.language, `${data.project.branch} flow`, data.project.owner]);
      list("#prerequisites", data.start.prerequisites);
      text("#commands", data.start.commands.join("\n"));
      text("#release-current", data.release.current);
      text("#release-optional", data.release.optional);
      text("#update", data.release.update);

      const structure = document.querySelector("#structure-body");
      for (const row of data.structure) {
        const tr = document.createElement("tr");
        for (const value of [row.path, row.purpose, row.owner]) {
          const td = document.createElement("td");
          td.textContent = value;
          tr.append(td);
        }
        structure.append(tr);
      }

      for (const item of data.workflow) {
        const article = document.createElement("article");
        article.className = "card";
        const title = document.createElement("strong");
        title.textContent = item.title;
        const detail = document.createElement("p");
        detail.textContent = item.detail;
        article.append(title, detail);
        document.querySelector("#workflow-cards").append(article);
      }

      const safeguards = document.querySelector("#safeguards");
      for (const value of data.safeguards) {
        const li = document.createElement("li");
        li.textContent = value;
        safeguards.append(li);
      }
    });
  </script>
</head>
<body>
  <a class="skip-link" href="#content">跳到主要內容</a>
  <div class="site">
    <aside class="sidebar">
      <p class="brand">CSARC INTERNAL</p>
      <nav aria-label="網站目錄">
        <a href="#start">開始使用</a>
        <a href="#structure">檔案地圖</a>
        <a href="#workflow">開發流程</a>
        <a href="#security">安全基線</a>
        <a href="#github-plan">GitHub 方案</a>
        <a href="#release">交付更新</a>
      </nav>
      <small>內容：site-content.js<br>版型：CSARC 公版</small>
    </aside>
    <main id="content">
      <header class="hero">
        <p class="eyebrow">Cyber-Arch / repository handbook</p>
        <h1 id="project-name">{{ project_name | e }}</h1>
        <p id="project-description" class="lead">{{ project_description | e }}</p>
        <div id="project-badges" class="badges" aria-label="專案標籤"></div>
      </header>

      <section id="start">
        <h2><span>開始使用</span></h2>
        <p>先安裝必要工具，再執行 repo 的共同驗證入口。</p>
        <div id="prerequisites" class="badges" aria-label="本機需求"></div>
        <pre id="commands" class="command"></pre>
      </section>

      <section id="structure">
        <h2><span>檔案地圖</span></h2>
        <table class="table">
          <thead><tr><th>路徑</th><th>用途</th><th>維護責任</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody id="structure-body"></tbody>
        </table>
      </section>

      <section id="workflow">
        <h2><span>開發流程</span></h2>
        <p>開 Issue／Milestone 前先搜尋 open／closed 歷史工作並摘要既有決策；PR 保留 Issue 連結與精簡清單。</p>
        <div id="workflow-cards" class="cards"></div>
      </section>

      <section id="security">
        <h2><span>安全基線</span></h2>
        <ul id="safeguards"></ul>
      </section>

      <section id="github-plan">
        <h2><span>GitHub 方案與門禁</span></h2>
        <p>repo 推送後會由 CI 讀取實際能力。有管理權且要啟用較強門禁時，可再執行 <code>./scripts/apply-repository-settings.sh plan</code>、<code>apply</code> 與 <code>check</code>；這不是 portable release baseline 的必要步驟。</p>
        <table class="table">
          <thead><tr><th>方案</th><th>公版會套用</th><th>方案邊界</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody>
            <tr><td><strong>Free＋public</strong></td><td>套用並強制 Ruleset</td><td>缺少或不符政策時，governance check fail-closed</td></tr>
            <tr><td><strong>Free organization＋private</strong></td><td>套用基本設定；期望 Ruleset 保留在 repo policy</td><td>公開 API 無法建立 Ruleset；check 標示 DEGRADED，PR 留言記錄限制</td></tr>
            <tr><td><strong>Pro 個人帳號＋private</strong></td><td>套用並強制 Ruleset</td><td>個人 private repo 的付費路徑</td></tr>
            <tr><td><strong>Team organization＋private</strong></td><td>Ruleset、必要審查、CODEOWNERS 與必要檢查</td><td>要先建立真實 CODEOWNERS team</td></tr>
            <tr><td><strong>Enterprise</strong></td><td>沿用 Team 的 repo 設定</td><td>SSO／SCIM、稽核串流、IP 限制與組織 Ruleset 屬組織層，不由本 repo 腳本自動修改</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
        <p class="notice"><strong>Free private 的下一步：</strong>需要保密就請 owner 升級至 GitHub Team 以上；只有已核准公開的程式碼才能由人員改為 public，腳本不會變更可見性。GitHub 設定頁雖可顯示 Ruleset 編輯器，REST 與 GraphQL 建立／更新 API 仍會回覆需升級或公開；因此自動化只會保存 repo 內的 policy，管理員也可在 Web UI 人工預建 disabled Ruleset。governance check 標示 <code>DEGRADED</code>、CI 與 release 繼續，PR 會留下警告留言；這些紀錄不能阻止有權限者直接 push 或忽略紅燈合併。</p>
      </section>

      <section id="release">
        <h2><span>交付與更新</span></h2>
        <p id="release-current" class="notice"></p>
        <table class="table">
          <thead><tr><th>Runtime 實測政策</th><th>模式</th><th>保證</th><th>限制／fallback</th></tr></thead>
          <tbody id="release-modes">
            <tr><td>PR、contents、Release、dispatch 都是 allowed</td><td><strong>Release PR</strong></td><td>release-please 保留可審查的版本與 changelog PR；合併後明確 dispatch 成品 workflow。</td><td>必要能力漂移時自動降級；不要求 App 或 PAT。</td></tr>
            <tr><td>PR blocked／unknown，其餘三項 allowed</td><td><strong>Direct</strong></td><td>只由最新 main 配置 tag 與 draft release；亂序 run 成為 no-op。</td><td>成品 checkout 暫時寫入版本；main 不另有版本／changelog commit。</td></tr>
            <tr><td>contents、Release 或 dispatch 任一非 allowed</td><td><strong>Verification only</strong></td><td>執行驗證並保存 machine-readable capability artifact，不建立 release。</td><td>不把未知權限當成功；後續 run 會依新政策重新判斷。</td></tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
        <p id="release-optional" class="notice optional"></p>
        <p id="update"></p>
      </section>

      <footer>這是內部說明頁，不是存取控制；發布時仍須由託管平台限制可見範圍。</footer>
    </main>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
